<Legal title="Privacy Policy">
  <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

  <p>
    <strong>Short version:</strong> rxova.org is a static website. It uses cookie-free, aggregate web
    analytics to understand which pages are useful, and does not use that data to identify or profile
    you.
  </p>

  <h2>What is collected</h2>
  <p>
    There are no accounts, advertising pixels, or marketing cookies, and rxova.org does not set
    cookies. Cloudflare Web Analytics reports aggregate measurements such as page path, referrer
    host, browser type, device type, and country. Rxova uses those reports to measure documentation
    usage and improve the site. Cloudflare states that Web Analytics does not collect or use
    visitors' personal data.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics provider</h2>
  <p>
    Cloudflare processes the analytics beacon on Rxova's behalf. Its service is designed to provide
    privacy-first aggregate measurements without client-side state such as cookies or local storage.
    See
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >Cloudflare Web Analytics</a
    > for provider details.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>
    rxova.org is served by GitHub Pages. As with any website, the host may process standard request
    metadata (such as your IP address and browser user-agent) in order to deliver pages and protect
    the service. That processing is governed by
    <a
      href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a
    >, not by this site.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Pages here link out to other services — npm, GitHub, and each project's documentation. Once you
    follow a link, that destination's own privacy policy applies.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? <a href="mailto:rxova@proton.me">rxova@proton.me</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
